# Testing

Follow `docs/TESTING_PLAN.md`.

- New foundation code gets GoogleTest coverage in the library that owns it, using `loco_add_library` `TEST_FILES`.
- Run `ctest --test-dir build/windows -C Debug --output-on-failure -R Modding` for loader changes, and the full suite when shared engine code changes.
- Tests must not read or write the Steam Locomotion folder or `%APPDATA%\OpenLoco`.
- A green build is not feature completion. Record the command and result in `docs/DEVELOPMENT_STATUS.md`.
- Add the scenario named in the testing plan before marking shunting, signals, lines, or cargo features complete.
